4:debug.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-v
Increase verbosity level (may be repeated, e.g., \-vv).
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-q, \-\-quiet
Quiet mode: no logging output.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
